- `"]]][[["`: all three `']'` are unmatched, so the answer is `ceil(3/2) = 2`.
- `"[]"`: nothing is unmatched, so the answer is 0.

The algorithm runs in O(n) time and O(1) extra space. It uses character codes to avoid string allocation.

